WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.250
- I love sharing cultures.

00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:02.410
You know, one way obviously

00:00:02.410 --> 00:00:04.930
to get to know different cultures is food.

00:00:04.930 --> 00:00:06.590
So I wanna know what's a food

00:00:06.590 --> 00:00:10.482
that you love that you think
that everyone should try?

00:00:10.482 --> 00:00:12.463
Maybe like a dessert.

00:00:14.440 --> 00:00:16.022
- Oh, you're talking about pandan cake?

00:00:16.022 --> 00:00:17.210
- Yeah.

00:00:17.210 --> 00:00:18.810
- I mean, so pandan cake is,

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:19.643
how would you describe it?

00:00:19.643 --> 00:00:21.150
It's a plant.

00:00:21.150 --> 00:00:22.670
- I want you to describe
it. It's your interview.

00:00:22.670 --> 00:00:23.610
- It's a very,

00:00:23.610 --> 00:00:25.580
(audience laughs)

00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:27.245
I could turn the tables again.

00:00:27.245 --> 00:00:28.980
(host and audience laughs)

00:00:28.980 --> 00:00:30.050
It's a plant.

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:32.250
It's a very specific green color,

00:00:32.250 --> 00:00:34.060
they make like cakes and stuff out of it.

00:00:34.060 --> 00:00:38.000
And it sort of tastes like
it's a little bit bitter,

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:40.330
but it's a little bit vanilla tasting too.

00:00:40.330 --> 00:00:42.220
It's a very specific taste.

00:00:42.220 --> 00:00:46.630
And a lot of like far East Asian countries

00:00:46.630 --> 00:00:49.130
have a dessert made from it.

00:00:49.130 --> 00:00:52.329
And it was my favorite
dessert flavor growing up.

00:00:52.329 --> 00:00:54.430
And it's very hard to find here, did you-

00:00:54.430 --> 00:00:55.787
- Are you on dessert right now?

00:00:55.787 --> 00:00:58.970
If I materialized one
right in front of you,

00:00:58.970 --> 00:01:01.160
hypothetically, would
you, you would eat some?

00:01:01.160 --> 00:01:01.993
- Don't say stuff you can't-

00:01:01.993 --> 00:01:03.620
