00:01:03.620 --> 00:01:04.453
and let's just see.

00:01:04.453 --> 00:01:05.650
(audience applauds)

00:01:05.650 --> 00:01:06.483
- Oh my God.

00:01:06.483 --> 00:01:08.240
- Thank you so much,
Justin. That's wonderful.

00:01:08.240 --> 00:01:10.390
Here you go.
- That is amazing.

00:01:10.390 --> 00:01:14.090
You got pandan cake. Oh my God.

00:01:14.090 --> 00:01:17.900
- This is from one of your
favorite bakeries, I believe,

00:01:17.900 --> 00:01:18.890
Mina, right?

00:01:18.890 --> 00:01:20.670
- Oh, really?
- [Host] minahrocks.la?

00:01:20.670 --> 00:01:23.040
- Yeah, she made it, that's amazing

00:01:23.040 --> 00:01:24.427
