00:01:25.410 --> 00:01:26.243
- Oh my God.

00:01:26.243 --> 00:01:28.680
(audience applauds)

00:01:28.680 --> 00:01:31.040
- I love watching you eat carbs.

00:01:31.040 --> 00:01:31.873
